WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:16.610
Number Omega 0502, Seiya Ichijo.
Release from cold sleep.

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:00.070
I like the sound of this.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:02.830
Right, here we go!

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:08.830
Seiya Ichijo.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.290
What's he like?

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:15.590
This is my first mission with him.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:21.260
But I've heard a lot about the Chakram,
and about the way he fights.

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:27.730
Epics from ancient India tell of a country
that angered the gods.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:32.020
Wielding a circle of light,
a messenger of the gods

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:34.650
came to punish the king and his people.

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:42.120
The light burned everything to ash.

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:48.580
Nothing remained of the kingdom,
not even a blade of grass.

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:54.880
It's said the ring of light
the messenger used was the Chakram.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:00.470
It was left behind and worshipped
as a weapon of the gods, then sealed away.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:07.720
Wielder of the Chakram as his core alma.
The Shoshidai's ultimate Chrysalis.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.100
That is Seiya Ichijo.

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:15.690
OGATA HOUSEHOLD

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:18.150
Gai, dinner's ready!

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:21.820
I made your favorite.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:23.240
Huh?

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:26.240
Gai?

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:40.760
Gai!

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:43.260
Hey, Gai.

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:48.640
Huh? Rain?

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:59.150
Gai, what's wrong?

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:03.360
Gai.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:09.240
<i>He's turned back into a baby.</i>

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:14.960
There, there.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:19.090
It's okay. I'll protect you.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.300
Let's go home.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.180
There's a festival today.

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:27.470
Remember? We used to go all the time.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.470
Let's go together, okay?

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:45.660
This is well-made.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.330
You've finally reached this level, huh?

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:49.700
Splendid.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:51.830
Thank you.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:55.330
What's wrong? You're not satisfied?

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:59.130
No. That's not it.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:03.470
A sword that cuts
through the blade of the heart...

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:07.760
that is your ideal sword, right?

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.510
I guess it's not quite there yet.

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:18.730
I heard you forged the Shiryu into an arm
for one of your apprentices?

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.400
So you already know?

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:24.990
Is that the reason for your glum face?

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:31.490
What's his name? The child.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.410
Gai.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:37.500
That's quite the bold move, though.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:42.050
What if the evil
of the Shiryu consumes him?

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:45.630
Naturally, I thought it over a great deal.

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:49.760
Indeed, the Shiryu
is a terrifying cursed sword.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:56.770
But it's been Gai's protector
since he was born.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:02.980
Only the Shiryu can cut through the blade
within his heart.

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.900
That's what I believe.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.410
The Shiryu, huh?

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:14.910
Isn't it said that
when a swordsmith wants to make a sword,

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.830
he makes two and chooses the better one?

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:22.250
Can we assume
there are two of the Shiryu as well?

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:23.960
I don't know.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.260
But the Shiryu is probably
the lesser of the two.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:31.180
No name was carved into it.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:39.520
I see. So, a superior version could exist
somewhere out there.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:44.270
FUJISHIRO SWORD SHARPENING

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:49.900
Heita, what's the most beautiful part
of a Japanese sword?

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:53.660
We're doing this again?

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:55.700
Just tell me.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.370
It's the blade, right?

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:01.670
That's right.

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:07.920
Even in the West, many swords
and weapons have hilts decorated with art.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:13.090
But the beauty of the blade itself,
which exists only to kill...

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:16.180
The katana
is the only weapon in the world

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:19.680
that's elevated the killing blade
to a form of beautiful art.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:23.810
The sharper we make the blade,
the more beautiful it becomes,

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:26.940
and the more beautiful it becomes,
the sharper it becomes.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:31.150
The ultimate weapon and the ultimate
beauty. That is the Japanese sword.

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:36.910
And it's our job as sharpeners to take
that beauty and sharpness to their limits.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.160
Is that right?

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.500
Hey! That belongs to a customer!

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:46.500
This salty, bitter mineral taste.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:51.420
This must be made from Akome iron sand,
found near the Seto Inland Sea!

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:57.100
The texture is evenly distributed,

00:07:57.180 --> 00:08:00.060
and you can see
where the hammer blows fell on it.

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:04.980
The forging must've been a perfect harmony
of water temperature and timing!

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.400
It's like the deep blue
of the calm Seto Sea,

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:11.440
and the refined,
elegant sunlight that falls on it.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.490
Cut me with it.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:20.250
I want you to cut me!
Cut me with it as hard as you can!

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.750
Wh-Wh-What are you talking about?

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:24.000
Just do it!

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:27.500
Come on, knock it off!

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:30.010
We have a lot of work to do!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:48.520
Why is my first outing in forever
in the middle of nowhere?

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:56.070
Well, it has been 16 years.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.040
Okay.

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.750
I tailored dad's old clothes
and they work great!

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:13.050
You need a yukata
for festivals, after all.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:28.440
Butterfly.

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:31.400
It's mine.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.070
It's been so long!

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:41.410
Let's go!

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:44.010
This is from a new customer.

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:48.520
They said it's a rush job
and left a lot of money.

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:52.730
Well, I like the idea of money, but...

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:10.620
This is... the Shiryu?

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:15.710
The one that belonged to Amon.
No, I heard he destroyed it!

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:18.880
It's in good condition.

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:21.680
It shouldn't take too long.

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.570
Kiyomi, this sound--

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.660
Don't speak to me right now!

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:09.140
Kiyomi?

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:13.390
<i>Kill. Kill. Kill.</i>

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:15.190
<i>Kill.</i>

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:38.590
Kiyomi?

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:44.880
G-Get out of here, now!
Don't come back in until I say it's okay!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:56.100
<i>Not enough... blood.</i>

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:02.440
<i>More... blood.</i>

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:09.450
<i>More blood. More.</i>

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:12.290
<i>More blood!</i>

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:54.540
The memories that remain in this body.

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:56.500
I see.

00:13:57.170 --> 00:14:00.040
So he loved these kinds of sounds?

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:02.630
They aren't bad.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:06.220
Zsoltgewinn!

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:09.140
You are...

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:12.220
the flame sword?

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.020
I've been looking for you.

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:20.650
What's wrong? Keep playing.
Tonight is your last.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.150
That shall be your requiem!

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:25.780
No, that's incorrect.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:29.910
This requiem... is for you!

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:41.170
We are cursed swords,
born in an age of myths.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:43.840
We're the same.

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:45.800
"We're the same"?

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:50.510
I have never lost a battle,
yet you lost to me once.

00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:09.030
Grimms.

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:11.240
Arnys?

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.450
Splendid.

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:19.410
Zsoltgewinn.
The sword wielded by the skull knight.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:23.540
Sixteen years ago,
it came to life once more as a Busoma,

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.380
and many Busoma have fallen to it.

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:30.880
He has trained quite well.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:37.010
I have been called the Reaper
since the birth of humanity,

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.890
and I have sent them to hell.

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:42.060
But that ends now.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:46.110
Humanity is nearing its death.

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:50.990
The era of the Busoma... is near.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:14.890
Gods, please watch over Gai.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:19.890
He's always kind of cold,
but I know he's a good guy.

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:23.230
And now he's like a little kid.

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:27.770
Help him get better
and return to who he was!

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:34.530
But after that, please make it
so he'll hang out with me once in a while.

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:37.700
Like going to karaoke or something.

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:40.290
Okay, let's go home.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:52.720
Wh-Wh-What?

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:57.090
Butterfly, are you there?

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.280
Gai!

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.780
Gai, are you okay?

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:18.910
Gai!

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:32.670
Butterfly.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.880
Mine alone.

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:41.100
Help me.

00:17:55.740 --> 00:18:00.160
Miss, it's useless to ask him for help.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.870
He's a Busoma.

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:07.670
He used to be human, but now he's just
a pitiful monster possessed by a weapon.

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:12.500
Don't get in my way!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:27.230
I assumed it would be finished by now.

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.980
Y-Yes, we just finished.

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:33.320
Would you like to take a look?

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:35.030
Well...

00:18:36.070 --> 00:18:40.450
I wanted to meet the sharpener,
but she must be tired.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:19:00.590
U-Um, what is that sword?

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:19.200
He's been completely consumed
by the weapon.

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:22.160
Unfortunately, there's no way to save him.

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:28.040
The only thing I can do...

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.210
is to end this quickly!

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:05.530
I don't want... to die.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:20.260
Well, the weapon took you over completely.

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:22.840
You should regret your weakness.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:26.640
What a boring job.

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:29.010
Sorry to bother you.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:31.270
No need to worry.

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:34.020
Well, just consider it a bad dream.

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:51.450
I see.
So you're the one I'm really here for.
